SRR5479519	PRJNA384287	SRP105271	SAMN06829305	SRX2763349	Mus musculus	MII Oocyte 2_RNA-seq	MII Oocyte 2_RNA-seq	Illumina HiSeq 2000 sequencing: GSM2588669: MII Oocyte 2_RNA-seq Mus musculus RNA-Seq	RNA-Seq	TRANSCRIPTOMIC	cDNA	PAIRED	ILLUMINA	Illumina HiSeq 2000	For MII oocyte and cleavage-stage embryos, the zona pellucida of embryos was removed by 0.5% pronase E (Sigma). Then the embryo was incubated in Ca2+ free CZB for 5 min. Polar bodies were removed by gentle pipetting using an inner diameter of 120 μm fire polished glass needle. For ICM and TE isolation, the zona pellucida of blastocysts was removed by 0.5% pronase E (Sigma). They were then incubated for 20 min in Ca2+ free CZB，the tight junctions TE cells and ICM cells were separated by gently pipetting in a pipette with a diameter of 40-60 μm.For epiblast (Epi) and extraembryonic ectoderm (Exe) isolation, embryos were cuttted at the embryonic/extraembryonic boundary using properly sharpened forceps. A fire-polished glass needle whose inner diameter is silghtly smaller than the width of the embryonic/extraembryonic fragment was used for separating epiblast or extraembryonic ectoderm from the visceral endoderm, and the epiblast or extraembryonic ectoderm were then incubated in Ca2+-free CZB for 10 min. Single cells were separated by gentle pipetting using a fire-polished glass needle with an inner diameter of 15-20 μm.200 cells were washed three times in 0.5% BSA-PBS solution per reaction. Libraries were prepared according to Ovation® RNA‑Seq System V2 (NuGEN, 7102) following the manufacturer's instructions.	26591830	6647957500	ftp.sra.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/fastq/SRR547/009/SRR5479519/SRR5479519_1.fastq.gz;ftp.sra.ebi.ac.uk/vol1/fastq/SRR547/009/SRR5479519/SRR5479519_2.fastq.gz	e0e81dfcb8898f412af3afca4d1b33ed;5b6edc847b05d7b0c3e8b9bd63ca5256	1580200754;1648736882
